<div class="bg-[#010e75]">
  <div class="container max-w-screen-md mx-auto">
    <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-bold text-white pt-8 md:pt-16 pb-12">News from the Github projects you like, straight into your inbox.</h1>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="relative">
  <div class="absolute w-full h-1/2 bg-[#010e75]"></div>
  <div class="relative z-1 container mx-auto max-w-screen-md">
    <a href="<%= Routes.page_path(@conn, :sample) %>"><img class="mx-auto shadow-[5px_5px_#444]" src="<%= Routes.static_path(@conn, "/images/sshot.png") %>"></a>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="container mx-auto max-w-screen-md text-lg">
  <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mt-16 mb-6">Don't miss anything</h2>
  <p class="my-2">It can be hard to follow all the interesting projects on Github. <strong class="text-emerald-500">Every Monday</strong>, we will <strong class="text-emerald-500">email you</strong> a digest of what happened in your starred repos.</p>

  <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mt-12 mb-6">Don't be overwhelmed</h2>
  <p>Save Github notifications for your own pressing work. Follow <strong class="text-emerald-500">releases</strong>, <strong class="text-emerald-500">issues</strong> or <strong class="text-emerald-500">commits</strong> in the projects you like at your own pace, from your mailbox.</p>

  <div class="flex justify-center items-center mt-8">
    <%= link "See a sample", to: Routes.page_path(@conn, :sample), class: "font-bold underline" %>
    <span class="mx-4 font-light">or</span>
    <%= link "Sign up", to: Routes.pow_registration_path(@conn, :new), class: "px-4 py-3 my-8 block text-lg font-medium text-white bg-[#0000dd] rounded" %>
  </div>

</div>
